  collect 12289 quest 4681                    -- Sea Turtle Remains, on the beach west of the docks; underwater
  turnin 4681                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde

step Buzzbox 827
  when onquest 983
  tip Only if you still carry Buzzbox 827's quest: the Tide Crawlers scuttle along the shore below the village, and Buzzbox 827 stands on the beach just south of the docks.
  collect 5385 quest 983 @35.6,47.1           -- Crawler Legs: the Tide Crawlers
  turnin 983                                  -- Buzzbox 827

step Darkshore Threshers
  tip Buzzbox 827 stands on the beach just south of the docks: once his crawler legs are in, he asks for Thresher Eyes. The Darkshore Threshers (12-14) swim in the shallows off the docks and up the shore to Mist's Edge; Buzzbox 411, who takes the eyes, stands north of Bashal'Aran at the end of the first loop.
  accept 1001                                 -- Buzzbox 827
  collect 5412 quest 1001 @33.8,38.4          -- Thresher Eyes; underwater

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- First loop: south-east and north-east

step Bears and the Blackwood camp
  tip Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills south of Auberdine: use Tharnariun's Hope on one to capture it. Then walk up to the furbolg camp just east of them: nothing to kill yet.
  complete 2118 @38.21,52.59 map 1439 era -- the Rabid Thistle Bears nearest Tharnariun
  complete 984 @39.9,53.9                     # any of four furbolg camps completes it; this is the one by the bears (#560)

step Ameth'Aran
  tip Sentinel Tysha Moonblade stands at the north edge of the ruins. Cursed, Writhing and Wailing Highborne haunt them; Anaya Dawnrunner's ghost walks among them, Jai'vhanel the owl circles east of them. The two tablets lie in the ruins; a Beached Sea Turtle lies on the shore west of them.
  accept 4722                                 -- Beached Sea Turtle
  accept 953                                  -- Sentinel Tysha Moonblade
  collect 5360 quest 958                      -- Highborne Relics
  collect 281038 quest 98025                  -- Feather of Jai'vhanel
  interact 17188 quest 953.1                  -- Read the Lay of Ameth'Aran
  interact 17189 quest 953.2                  -- Read the Fall of Ameth'Aran
  turnin 953

step The red crystal
  tip Climb the eastern mountains east of Ameth'Aran; the Mysterious Red Crystal sits on a ledge.
  complete 4811 @47.2,48.7                    -- Mysterious Red Crystal

step Bashal'Aran
  tip North along the hills. Asterion waits in the ruins of Bashal'Aran; Wild Grells and Vile Sprites fill them, Deth'ryll Satyrs the eastern edge. Buzzbox 411 stands by the road north-north-west of Asterion; a Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore on the way to him.
  turnin 954                                  -- Asterion
  accept 955
  collect 5336 quest 955 @44.6,36.6 map 1439 -- Grell Earrings
  turnin 955
  accept 956
  collect 5338 quest 956 @45.5,36.5 map 1439 -- Ancient Moonstone Seal: Deth'ryll Satyrs
  turnin 956
  accept 957
  accept 4723                                 -- Beached Sea Creature

step Buzzbox 411
  tip North-north-west of Asterion by the road, past the Beached Sea Creature: Buzzbox 411 wants Moonstalker Fangs next, from the second loop's hills. Then south-west down to Auberdine.
  turnin 1001                                 -- Buzzbox 411
  accept 1002

