step Cerellean Whiteclaw
  tip Cerellean Whiteclaw waits where the pier meets the shore. Anaya Dawnrunner (16), whose pendant he wants, walks Ameth'Aran on the loop ahead: from level 14.5 you take it there, else on your next Darkshore visit.
  accept 963                                  -- Cerellean Whiteclaw, on the pier

step Rabid Thistle Bear on the way
  along until q2138
  kill 2164 quest 2138

step Moonstalkers on the way
  along until q1002
  tip The Moonstalkers (14-15) roam the hills of the loop ahead, south of Auberdine and around the Cliffspring River at its end: any of them drops the fangs. Leave the Moonstalker Sires (17-18) and Matriarchs (19-20) south of the Grove.
  collect 5413 quest 1002                     -- Moonstalker Fangs

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Second loop

step Blackwood furbolgs
  zone Darkshore
  tip Blackwood Pathfinders and Windtalkers hold the camp south-east of Auberdine; Rabid Thistle Bears roam the hills around it.
  tip Careful: the Windtalkers (13-14) cast from range and the furbolgs stand in pairs: pull them one at a time.
  kill 2167 quest 985
  kill 2324 quest 985

step The southern beaches
  tip Follow the coast south past Ameth'Aran: one Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore west of the Grove, another further south near Remtravel's Excavation. Three more remains lie further south-west among Greymist Oracles and Tidehunters (18-20): the guide leaves them for the last loop, when you are closer to their level.
  accept 4728                                 -- Beached Sea Creature

step Onu
  when onquest 952
  tip From the beached creature, head east to the Grove of the Ancients. Watch for level 16 bears and level 17 Moonstalker Sires between the beach and the grove; go around them. Onu stands beside Arbal and the sleeping Kerlonian Evershade.
  turnin 952 only NightElf                    -- Onu

step Ameth'Aran
  label q2138
  tip Back north to Ameth'Aran: the flame burns in the south of the ruins.
  interact 16393 quest 957.1 @42.4,61.8 map 1439 -- Ancient Flame
  kill 2164 quest 2138

step Anaya's Pendant
  when level>=14.5
  when onquest 963
  tip Careful: Anaya Dawnrunner (16) is over you: pull her on her own at full health. Lady Moongazer, a rare (17), also walks the ruins: leave her be.
  collect 5382 quest 963                      -- Anaya's Pendant: Anaya Dawnrunner's ghost walks the ruins

step The red crystal
  tip Back north-east into the mountains to the crystal.
  turnin 4812                                 -- Mysterious Red Crystal
  accept 4813

step Rabid Thistle Bear
  kill 2164 quest 2138

step Bashal'Aran
  tip North along the hills to Asterion, then on north-east to the Cliffspring River.
  turnin 957                                  -- Asterion

step Cliffspring Falls
  tip North-east up the Cliffspring River to the falls: fill the sampler at the water there. Moonstalkers (14-15) roam the hills around the river.
  tip Careful: Encrusted Tide Crawlers (17-20) line the shore below the falls and the Den Mother's bears (18-19) lair in the hills south of them: keep to the river.
  use 12350 quest 4762.1 @50.8,25.6 map 1439
  collect 12349 quest 4762                    -- Cliffspring River Sample, at the waterfall

step Buzzbox 323
  label q1002
  tip Buzzbox 323 stands on the hill above the falls. He offers Buzzbox 525 next: its bears are far south, for your next Darkshore visit.
  collect 5413 quest 1002                     -- Moonstalker Fangs: the Moonstalkers around the river
  turnin 1002                                 -- Buzzbox 323

step Beached Sea Turtle
  tip West along the north shore: the Beached Sea Turtle lies on the beach north of Bashal'Aran, among Reef Crawlers and Greymist Warriors (15). Then south-west down to Auberdine.
  accept 4725                                 -- Beached Sea Turtle

