step Baros Alexston
  only NightElf
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Baros Alexston stands in Cathedral Square, west of the Trade District: his compass is in his old house in Westfall, on the way. His reply to Thundris goes back to Auberdine with you.
  turnin 97914                                -- Baros Alexston: Thundris Windweaver's letter
